  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greater Caribbean Safeguarding Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Greater Caribbean Safeguarding Initiative (GCSI) and its partners in the Greater Caribbean Region the opportunity to establish a perimeter defense against the introduction of high-risk plant pests into the region through collaborative efforts to harmonize quarantines, exclusion strategies, and other safeguarding initiatives. GCSI&apos;s mission is to strengthen the safeguarding system in this region by establishing partnerships with regional countries and partner organizations to prevent, detect, and control existing and emerging plant pest threats.</narrative>
  </description>
